    "WHY THIS EXISTS: the google-services Gradle plugin hard-fails when",
    "app/google-services.json is missing, which would block compiling and testing the",
    "~90% of this app that has nothing to do with Firebase. The real file is gitignored",
    "(it identifies the project), so CI injects it from the GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON secret",
    "and falls back to this when the secret is absent — on forks, or before setup.",
    "",
    "Every id below is fabricated. An APK built against this cannot reach Firebase: no",
    "sign-in, no sync. That is intentional and adequate for verifying that the code",
    "compiles and the tests pass. The release workflow refuses to run without the real",
    "secret, so this can never ship to a phone by accident."
  ],
